We would like to announce Batch Sender 1.0 version. 
http://www.pivari.com/batch-sender.html

Batch Sender is shareware; it is a powerful command line tool, that
can run on Windows (DOS), Solaris, Linux, AIX, HPUX (if you need we
can make a special executable for other OS like Mac OS X, SCO, BSD,
IRIX, Tru64, ...) in the same way.
You need an SMTP host (in your company o in your ISP). With Batch
Sender you can use SMTP to send batch emails.
Every possible option is by command line or in the default
configuration file batchsender.cfg

What's new in this version

The first public release. 

Download the demo Linux (intel) version at
http://www.pivari.com/archive/batchsenderl.tar.gz

